nI need to locate the budget spreadsheet, so I’ll start by searching for the keyword \\\"budget.\\\" Once I find it, I can select it. I think I can perform the operations in parallel, which should help streamline things. It’s important to keep everything efficient, as I want to get this done smoothly for the user. Alright, let’s aim to execute this search and get that budget spreadsheet sorted!\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129a3884887d0add23430f9467009\",\"call_id\":\"call_1ULPqFaiKsY0l2h12mLPwNSP\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"budget\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"Dana\\\",\\\"limit\\\":10}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129a3885887d09c9ec40d7884c2f5\",\"call_id\":\"call_XOCdqgJSzhdr5OKl1H0rc1ab\",\"name\":\"drive\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"budget\\\",\\\"limit\\\":20}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129a3886087d0a0c65cd2ae234de3\",\"call_id\":\"call_LBqUvXRddkOBBAnHqi7UZM0B\",\"name\":\"calendar\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"list\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"2026-05-06T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"to\\\":\\\"2026-05-09T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"limit\\\":100}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_1ULPqFaiKsY0l2h12mLPwNSP\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"msg_c89e839033cd4dba\\\",\\n      \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_ebc29ed5a10a434a\\\",\\n      \\\"from\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"to\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"email\\\": \\\"me@example.test\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sam Example\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\n      \\\"sent_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"unread\\\": true,\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"INBOX\\\",\\n        \\\"UNREAD\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_XOCdqgJSzhdr5OKl1H0rc1ab\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"files\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"file\\\": \\\"file_42d6e32517074237\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Q3 Budget\\\",\\n      \\\"mime_type\\\": \\\"application/vnd.google-apps.spreadsheet\\\",\\n      \\\"modified_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-08T17:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"modified_by\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\",\\n      \\\"native_type\\\": \\\"spreadsheet\\\",\\n      \\\"web_url\\\": \\\"https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_LBqUvXRddkOBBAnHqi7UZM0B\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"events\\\": []\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be0a-76cc-74ee-a458-65187ccdabeb\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
