er\":102,\"summary_index\":0,\"text\":\"**Clarifying calendar dates**\\n\\nI need to draft something, but there’s a date mismatch in the calendar. It looks like tomorrow should be November 10, based on the email received on November 9. Yet, the system shows May 6. I should probably respect the system's date, but maybe I should check the calendar for events on November 10? Since there are no events currently showing for May, I'll need to verify for any potential events scheduled for the future. Plus, I need to draft a reply to Dana.\"}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_part.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_part.done\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129acb2d487d0a52623961c54c7ec\",\"output_index\":0,\"part\":{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying calendar dates**\\n\\nI need to draft something, but there’s a date mismatch in the calendar. It looks like tomorrow should be November 10, based on the email received on November 9. Yet, the system shows May 6. I should probably respect the system's date, but maybe I should check the calendar for events on November 10? Since there are no events currently showing for May, I'll need to verify for any potential events scheduled for the future. Plus, I need to draft a reply to Dana.\"},\"sequence_number\":103,\"summary_index\":0}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_part.added\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_part.added\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129acb2d487d0a52623961c54c7ec\",\"output_index\":0,\"part\":{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"\"},\"sequence_number\":104,\"summary_index\":1}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\",\"delta\":\"**Drafting email and checking calendar**\\n\\nI'm\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129acb2d487d0a52623961c54c7ec\",\"obfuscation\":\"SbU\",\"output_index\":0,\"sequence_number\":105,\"summary_index\":1}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\nda