to draft a reply to Dana.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Drafting email and checking calendar**\\n\\nI'm set to draft an email about the Q3 budget numbers, using the exact recipient and including a link to the sheet with a note about bringing it up in the meeting. It makes sense to create this draft while also checking the calendar for November 10. Since the actual calendar shows May 7 with no events, I might need to mention the message date instead of asking for clarification. I should check for any possible meetings around November 10, just in case!\"}]},\"output_index\":0,\"sequence_number\":198}\n\nevent: response.output_item.added\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.added\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"fc_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129b296f487d09966ac261b082d97\",\"type\":\"function_call\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"arguments\":\"\",\"call_id\":\"call_aUupeE7FVgrr4Y920ISTARkd\",\"name\":\"mail\"},\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":199}\n\nevent: response.function_call_arguments.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.function_call_arguments.delta\",\"delta\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"draft\\\",\\\"to\\\":[\\\"dana@example.test\\\"],\\\"subject\\\":\\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Hi Dana,\\\\n\\\\nI'll bring the Q3 budget sheet to the planning review. Here's the link: https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\\n\\\\nBest,\\\\nSam\\\",\\\"reply_to\\\":\\\"msg_c89e839033cd4dba\\\"}\",\"item_id\":\"fc_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129b296f487d09966ac261b082d97\",\"obfuscation\":\"x\",\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":200}\n\nevent: response.function_call_arguments.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.function_call_arguments.done\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"draft\\\",\\\"to\\\":[\\\"dana@example.test\\\"],\\\"subject\\\":\\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Hi Dana,\\\\n\\\\nI'll bring the Q3 budget sheet to the planning review. Here's the link: https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\\n\\\\nBest,\\\\nSam\\\",\\\"reply_