esponse**\\n\\nI see that there are no events scheduled for May 7, which is \\\"tomorrow\\\" according to the system date. However, the user is asking about their calendar, expecting to see something. There’s an email from Dana referencing a planning review for November 10, which creates a date discrepancy. I'll need to clarify this and mention that calendar events are listed in UTC. It might be helpful to include a link to the budget sheet in my response along with a short note. There's no need to delve into the event details.\"}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_part.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_part.done\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129b41f2087d0aae2d2a8b766c92b\",\"output_index\":0,\"part\":{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Drafting a calendar response**\\n\\nI see that there are no events scheduled for May 7, which is \\\"tomorrow\\\" according to the system date. However, the user is asking about their calendar, expecting to see something. There’s an email from Dana referencing a planning review for November 10, which creates a date discrepancy. I'll need to clarify this and mention that calendar events are listed in UTC. It might be helpful to include a link to the budget sheet in my response along with a short note. There's no need to delve into the event details.\"},\"sequence_number\":294,\"summary_index\":2}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"rs_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129b41f2087d0aae2d2a8b766c92b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8Sm7pU1v1-wtHI7M94hWNmP_5eImVR_eRfqINLsbNyqUZo9cAXfI-esYtYYxLV-OltCquADUUFj3UB3wMJMKuk8HDEg9iWRy7Dp9r-TaALAWVt6URY2af-XkFoXTlqZAGi-aEGJOLpO5A2O-8_9xbEa88CVX5nx4O0ZuuI63Fe6TgIYziKDP2RLMom_CfTZcpaSrt3EWZqcNyRVGzFg5ANywY6Bz3XzuSP12yS7uQeTQxONfQG34yb8bnFbAXfrh2VZWEDSkkDMAZ5n6T1bSaEtd6Igi4IWYxsbMf9P9bdTTdfpBZDMy_JnRdqDWcFrsrcUjA5sd49Ll5so8vmu_WsrC118jcf7BdhPwS16wlCfIzoF8R7toXBWBXjlwHDgsaMAcM