 be helpful to include a link to the budget sheet in my response along with a short note. There's no need to delve into the event details.\"}]},{\"id\":\"rs_0e6a343a89d8c3d3016af129bbaf8887d0ab251adec62175eb\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8Sm9t8qTiArzSlrJDJKXpA53EdXNkeZnUdxh5ct0OeO3fAgz_ZGl9_5IFULtfOv9IhH65VbufTjISRJtcwCmKLtlR3O3z1L173fdJBXkh3--jCqzBZfxhchavNBdy-AI-bprRwyw9IUcFnd9vnI7VhrOWZKOi9Vw11peitL1lxLahGeNm0-ocS00KwkFTvVNyjIMTo246IKQ1if_UwJ17otjdnvsJChAv_avCpaPouNPKVay3J_9U74pMW8s05DVPOYaSdB77k8FN27zSrifRInaMomS3gzsczDm2coqJzcTJAzDXcSNbrM-A3vAaxwA9rvBmv7ka9RGoPLQ3hksOd1JJSWL8HXwc4JmYeFEMA0sV8PBBFnqkV7yp_9T5AJr4_z65TBAddFVYrfLddD6cFoX9YLmDBO4r0NRdXxPzssObM3yVCbhhD4GuPjb8EH-7ZI767sMRpdo6ZpBrwHjwqmdQ4NUiI9FNjn70SiJwNDWrmujiwOZ_LAoiiZxrwkjfrGihEqgDm-Z2jpad4bXIfc3xyvaS6wCY1Toly5JjqqBs4BXHnqu30xeZNOZFYR5zJoDomXc6krDqYXCSyTcDzW3aI4JI9f4ocaqniUeXt2IpzIDFDd2Qjzd8pBF009toqcMuupp3p7FEXhqwXLOg-B2jxMIBrGUx4Zs6uJHUz3tk2b5r_o-EIKjNW0NVEbE63rP0JiTqZjXBeMf_1jBXgUDvW1Jvul22VOz1yQNK14qaNxQnfvpvy1wvVadCiSnceyF1RM6VQSluaWXYHGX8Yt2zaWhOE_SwXWB5Q7aumz41EABiRHN4X6oMKT-Gf-hQ4bsV0UEAfJYuaTHE-CwDSrnbFCUcecNdegos3Oaf2tbgsITd0jZrA-u-CimJp65pL9PFhCtNUhjDVtskBkVAFElBWYTmXCKx2e5TH9Vs10M3rpPqI3tplbsmS9SV8nif27ux_lGPhzd_03i5u7rkgwJpL5mY98PvMvp9rWLvDpU-pw2xVrykYykewCt4q-189MYszt49fiilFBSGTUg5f_bJnKTMLym22L72f6nbptBVkYnhQyyrqLRa9badAdPl8K5oXA_oTnA6ZdZIIrBhskhhook7h6XL9nS3wGsg1MiWVxG4hJJmlS6vdunAK16iFd56oVRq-hgBn2pipP4NlmE6zwujLRTnbgi1kWFAYM0GlvItM5tCzD7T2KF636bVAhR5D0gELgPfNyTKq7sBMvuKQXZux8QyEAKnRkxlgBp1HYHzrhDUVjWdJJVMGvuv1v27Txk2lfNbgda942ZPYfFX-utjDkbFZiAW0SQ8_eVeOoArgaCxJr-uLg4YqETdSywrSAwPY1jtpVRQ1XOKFchkNPZeR01p0EsvV7ohj9hEva8ujddECin5AOIKHuM9GTR_DQZ0BTKrtKTQOtLh-2PCgFbAouokAe2CEM2lApQATsB4X0ggWkN9owLJShYws2xxCJHTdfTTa-l_Tphf371mevsKZ50d76rSNWIe0-OiUXHy0FYZ2sWdZ4816__bWvzmmOOyHKTer8cDH-93JFY2izNMwKvtPDEC_nuDMVY3JaJdCIUJp-Ztgtuw9FNQwgwEdXvQ7Qrd1y1VyKKPzNVN6k4IYw--68gGnCPmUMUce36St76NwDEoiwx4JuR8li4PZTERoMKb8KBRXT3-czgubA3oBVp2vg_faVB7KvVCIF2Dx7Nd49F